# Review routing.
#
# Task pages are intentionally NOT owned by anyone: the point of one-file-per-task
# is that contributors merge their own work without a bottleneck.
#
# The shared surfaces below do need review, because a bad change there affects
# everybody at once. The rules are commented out until the organisation has these
# teams (or name people instead, e.g. @handle): GitHub flags owners that do not
# exist, and requests no review from them.

# /state/taxonomy.yml       @embodied-agent-interface-v2-internal/benchmark-maintainers
# /data/benchmarks/         @embodied-agent-interface-v2-internal/benchmark-maintainers
# /state/runs/              @embodied-agent-interface-v2-internal/benchmark-maintainers

# /scripts/                 @embodied-agent-interface-v2-internal/tooling
# /mkdocs.yml               @embodied-agent-interface-v2-internal/tooling
# /overrides/               @embodied-agent-interface-v2-internal/tooling
# /.github/                 @embodied-agent-interface-v2-internal/tooling
# /requirements.txt         @embodied-agent-interface-v2-internal/tooling
